  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Digitalisation of education in 20 rural schools.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A project of Reaching Hand called &apos;Namma shale&apos;, which means My School in Kannada, aims to empower government schools by digitising schools to provide inclusive education in the following ways: - 1. Quality education by supporting teachers on a temporary basis. -2. Developing minor infrastructure in schools. -3. Providing stem labs, computer labs &amp; digital panels etc.-4. Providing necessities like bags, water bottle etc. -4. Conducting co-curricular activities for holistic development.</narrative>
  </description>
